      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_GymDoorLocked",
      "en_US": [
        "The doors are locked tight.\r",
        "A note is taped to the glass:\n",
        "“Opening soon! - Prof. Oak”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_BerryField_Text_Sign",
      "en_US": [
        "BERRY FIELD\n",
        "Plant any BERRY. It grows as you walk!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_BerryField_Text_Soil",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s soft, freshly turned soil.\n",
        "Plant a BERRY here?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_BerryField_Text_Planted",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} planted a {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\n",
        "in the soil."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_ChanseyStatue",
      "en_US": [
        "A statue of CHANSEY.\r",
        "The plaque reads:\n",
        "“May all who visit PALLET TOWN\f",
        "leave a little happier.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_ChanseyStatueLegend",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s smaller writing under it…\r",
        "“CHANSEY shares her luck with any\n",
        "who share theirs.\r",
        "Leave a clover at her feet, and\n",
        "her egg will grow luckier.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_GymFinale_Text_CeremonyMomHere",
      "en_US": [
        "MOM: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Over here, honey!\n",
        "Everyone’s waiting for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_GymFinale_Text_CeremonyOfficial1",
      "en_US": [
        "LEAGUE OFFICIAL: Ahem!\n",
        "Ladies and gentlemen!\r",
        "On behalf of the Pokémon LEAGUE,\n",
        "welcome to the opening of KANTO’s\f",
        "newest Gym!\r",
        "For the first time in its history,\n",
        "PALLET TOWN has a Gym of its own."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_GymFinale_Text_CeremonyOfficial2",
      "en_US": [
        "And leading it is the new CHAMPION\n",
        "of the Pokémon LEAGUE…\r",
        "PALLET TOWN’s very own…\r",
        "Leader {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_GymFinale_Text_CeremonyOfficial3",
      "en_US": [
        "LEAGUE OFFICIAL: Every challenger\n",
        "who walks through those doors will\f",
        "face Leader {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "Beat them, and they’ll earn the\n",
        "LEAGUE’s newest BADGE!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_GymFinale_Text_CeremonyMomProud",
      "en_US": [
        "MOM: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}… A Gym Leader!\n",
        "I’m so proud of you, honey!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_GymFinale_Text_CeremonyDaisyWheresGrandpa",
      "en_US": [
        "DAISY: Congratulations, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "…That’s strange. Has anyone seen\n",
        "Grandpa?\r",
        "He’s never missed anything like\n",
        "this. Not once!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_GymFinale_Text_CeremonyOfficialGoIn",
      "en_US": [
        "LEAGUE OFFICIAL: Now then, Leader.\n",
        "Your Gym awaits!\r",
        "Would you do the honors?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_GymFinale_Text_OakComeToTheGym",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! There you are!\r",
        "Come with me to the Gym.\n",
        "There’s something we need to\f",
        "talk about…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_OakLetMeSeePokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "You’re back, are you?\r",
        "How much have you filled in your\n",
        "Pokédex?\r",
        "May I see it?\r",
        "Let’s see…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_CaughtXImpressiveFollowMe",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve caught… {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!?\n",
        "Now, this is impressive!\r",
        "There’s something I wanted to ask\n",
        "of you, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "Come.\n",
        "Follow me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_DadStory_Text_MomSendoff",
      "en_US": [
        "MOM: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, you’ve grown up so fast.\r",
        "I always knew I’d see this day, but I\n",
        "didn’t think it would come so soon.\r",
        "You know… you’re so much like your dad.\r",
        "He wanted to become a Gym Leader too…\n",
        "among other things.\r",
        "Of course, there was no Gym in PALLET\n",
        "TOWN when he was around.\r",
        "But it was always his ambition to become\n",
        "the best Pokémon Trainer.\r",
        "You have a chance to do what he didn’t.\n",
        "Go make him proud!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_DadStory_Text_MemorialOak1",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Your MOTHER called me\n",
        "from VIRIDIAN. I heard everything.\r",
        "I knew your father, you know. He was a\n",
        "brilliant man. One of the brightest minds\f",
        "I’ve ever met.\r",
        "He could build anything he set his mind\n",
        "to. But brilliance draws attention…\r",
        "And he fell in with the wrong crowd."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_DadStory_Text_MemorialMom1",
      "en_US": "MOM: He did, at first. But not at the end."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_DadStory_Text_MemorialOak2",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: No. Not at the end.\r",
        "When he turned on GIOVANNI, TEAM ROCKET\n",
        "never truly recovered. You saw to the\f",
        "rest today.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, have you ever wondered why\n",
        "there’s a CHANSEY statue in PALLET\f",
        "TOWN?\r",
        "The town put it up after your father\n",
        "passed. For what he did to weaken TEAM\f",
        "ROCKET…\r",
        "…and for the CHANSEY he made to heal,\n",
        "not to hurt.\r",
        "“May all who visit PALLET TOWN leave a\n",
        "little happier.” That was his idea of\f",
        "what Pokémon are for."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_DadStory_Text_MemorialMom2",
      "en_US": [
        "MOM: He would have hated having a\n",
        "statue. But he’d have loved that it’s a\f",
        "CHANSEY."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_DadStory_Text_MemorialOak3",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: Ho ho! That he would.\r",
        "Oh, and one more thing. I spoke with the\n",
        "LEAGUE before I came out here.\r",
        "After what happened at VIRIDIAN,\n",
        "they’ve agreed to count its Leader’s\f",
        "approval as given.\r",
        "VIRIDIAN’s Leader is gone, after all. And\n",
        "you beat him fair and square.\r",
        "That makes eight, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. The ELITE\n",
        "FOUR are waiting for you.\r",
        "But before you go… VIRIDIAN has a new\n",
        "Leader already. He came by my lab this\f",
        "morning asking for you.\r",
        "He said he has something that belonged\n",
        "to your father. I’d go and see him first."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_DadStory_Text_MemorialMom3",
      "en_US": "MOM: Go on, honey. Make us proud."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_RaisingMonsToo",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m raising Pokémon, too.\r",
        "When they get strong, they can\n",
        "protect me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_SignsAreUsefulArentThey",
      "en_US": "Signs are useful, aren’t they?"
    },
