      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_ChanseyStatueEggLevel",
      "en_US": [
        "The LUCKY EGG is now Lv. {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It gives {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}x the Exp. Points."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_GymFinale_Text_CeremonyMentor",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Look at you up there!\r",
        "When we met in OAK’s lab, I wasn’t\n",
        "sure you’d make it past your first\f",
        "Gym.\r",
        "Welcome to the club, Leader!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_OakYouEnjoyingTraveling",
      "en_US": [
        "OAK: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "You seem to be enjoying traveling.\r",
        "Knowing you, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, I can easily\n",
        "imagine you going out to even more\f",
        "exotic locales.\r",
        "Good for you, good for you.\n",
        "Hohoho."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_CaughtXPuttingInHonestEffort",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve caught {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}…\r",
        "Hm, it looks as if you’re putting\n",
        "in an honest effort.\r",
        "When you manage to fill it some\n",
        "more, come show me, please."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_LookCopiedTrainerTipsSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Look, look!\r",
        "I copied what it said on one of\n",
