    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_PalletTown_Text_ChanseyStatueShort",
      "en_US": [
        "To make the LUCKY EGG luckier,\n",
        "CHANSEY wants {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0446_T01_TypeTutor_Text_Bye",
